-- Maraudon, orange wing (map 349): the plan rows of dungeons/maraudon_orange.json, exported from turtle-agent d59b259
-- (prep/maraudon_orange) after the first census pass of the wing, status 'draft (not mapped, not live-checked)':
--   turtle-agent plan-export --mmaps ~/turtle-agent-mmaps --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --approach-hops \
--     --rev d59b259 --stamp 20261024010100 --out <dir> maraudon_orange
-- Stacks on nothing: no other module has map-349 rows. NO ROW IS HAND-SET. The export options and the plan-check result
-- (1 of 349 points fail: the Rotgrip boss point is needs_walk; 83 estimated patrol periods and 2 detours warn) are in
-- ~/TortoiseBots-audit/PREP-MARAUDON-ORANGE-2026-10-24.md.
--
-- WHAT THIS IS. The draft skeleton (a cluster per boss) turned into 120 pulls from the map-349 spawn export, 6 legs,
-- 995 steps: Noxxion, Razorlash, Landslide, Tinkerer Gizlock, Rotgrip, Princess Theradras.
--   * the critters (2914 Snake, 13321 Frog, 6145 School of Fish, 4076 Roach, 50 spawns in 50 draft groups) are out of
--     every pack, and the 27 groups that were a pull of a critter alone are gone;
--   * one pull per creature_groups assist chain: the linked partners of a pulled spawn are in its group (Deep Borers of
--     guid 89008-89016 and 89012-89057 in leg 3, several larvae and vines in leg 0), and the 8-Vile-Larva pulls are one
--     linked pack each (they aggro together and cannot be split);
--   * radius = the farthest member from the group centre + its wander (0.5 for a static member, floor 5); the draft used
--     farthest + 10, which reached the next pack;
--   * the pulls are ordered nearest-neighbour inside each leg, the boss last, with a 100 yd penalty on a floor change:
--     the tiers of this map are 40-75 yd apart and a walk between two of them is 250-500 yd of hop chain. The same group
--     set walks 19,296 yd in the export's own rows, against 24,402 yd in the draft's order (6 min at 7 yd/s);
--   * two groups that stood nearer another leg's packs moved (leg 5's 309.6 97.9 -131.8 and 351.2 205.0 -102.3 are now in
--     leg 2, where the north tier is cleared), and each leg's `to` is its new first pull.
--
-- UNIT LISTS. cc_priority 11793 11794 (Celebrian Dryad and Sister of Celebrian: the only humanoids of the wing, the
-- mage's Polymorph); kill_first 12217 12219 12222 (Corruptor's Corruption, Barbed Lasher's Thorn Volley, Creeping
-- Sludge's Noxious Cloud); fleers 12216 (Poison Sprite, EventAI flee at 15 %) and no_cc (every elemental, demon, slime,
-- giant and beast that a Polymorph does not land on) are unexpressed: no column, see the plan notes.
--
-- WHAT THE ROWS CANNOT CARRY. 83 of the pulls carry a patrol block in the plan (a hostile patroller whose
-- creature_movement path comes within 25 yd of the pull, mostly the long Theradrim Guardian loops of the inner ring),
-- with an estimated round; the run leader's rows have no patrol column and it meets them mid-beat. Rotgrip (13596) and
-- Princess Theradras (12201) walk 382 yd and 104 yd paths of their own and their boss rows use the spawn point. Noxxion
-- summons Noxxion's Spawn (13456) every 40 s; Princess Theradras summons 12238 on aggro. The leg-2 transit of the east
-- corridor passes 98 live spawns of the unplanned Vyletongue side within 25 yd (see the prep note).
--
-- BOSS BLOCK. Entry-scoped to this plan's six bosses: another plan's map-349 rows (the purple wing shares Landslide,
-- Tinkerer Gizlock, Rotgrip and Princess Theradras) survive this file.

-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

-- maraudon_orange: map 349, 6 legs, 995 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_orange';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_orange';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'maraudon_orange';

-- The six bosses of this plan, entry-scoped (maraudon_purple's rows of the shared inner bosses survive).
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_boss` WHERE `map` IN (349) AND `entry` IN (13282, 12258, 12203, 13601, 13596, 12201);
